# ⚠ a DuckDB collation changes what equality means. DuckDB binds `nocase` as lower(), which is pushed as LOWER — the
# ONE accepted divergence (user decision 2026-10-25): SQL Server maps 298 rare BMP code points differently (ß, µ,
# Greek symbol forms, …); for this data, as for Latin text, the answer is DuckDB's
