# ═══ §15  Dates: date_trunc and date/time constants ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# date_trunc is Substrait's round_calendar (FLOOR, one unit; the week is the ISO week, Monday) and DATETRUNC on
# the server (2022+). A DATE is truncated to a TIMESTAMP, as DuckDB does.

